SUMMARY:Admission Requirements
DESCRIPTION:Admission Requirements General Requirements Iraqi Preparatory Certificate or equivalent Meeting required average for college and major Passing medical examination (for health colleges) No disciplinary dismissal from another university Required Documents Original graduation certificate with certified copy Civil Status ID National Card Iraqi Nationality Certificate Recent passport photos (6 photos) Admission Averages College Scientific Literary Medicine 98+ - Engineering 85+ - Science 70+ - Law - 75+ Averages are approximate and vary annually\n
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
