SUMMARY:International Students
DESCRIPTION:International Students - Study in Iraq Al-Qadisiyah University welcomes international students from around the world.\nStudy in Iraq Program A government program to attract international students to study at Iraqi universities.\nBenefits Competitive tuition fees University accommodation Student visa Academic support Required Documents Valid passport Certified academic certificates Health certificate Passport photos Application Steps Register via Study in Iraq Portal Choose university and program Submit documents Receive conditional acceptance Complete visa procedures Contact Email: international@qu.edu.iq 
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
